{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"d8f0c4409600eaf9","x":-360,"y":-40,"width":115,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"# Crunch"},
		{"id":"dd23387b86240b9c","x":-160,"y":-61,"width":479,"height":102,"type":"text","text":"> Crunch ek command-line tool hai jo user ke diye gaye rules ke hisaab se combinations generate karta hai."},
		{"id":"ba99a6ab832f441a","x":537,"y":-61,"width":442,"height":102,"color":"#030303","type":"text","text":"```\ncrunch <min-len> <max-len> [charset] [options]\n```"},
		{"id":"d3d6505696264777","x":476,"y":180,"width":565,"height":140,"type":"text","text":"##### Sirf length specify kiya (default charset = lowercase)\n```\ncrunch 1 3\n```"},
		{"id":"4bcc9667201bb495","x":476,"y":430,"width":565,"height":293,"type":"text","text":"### Custom Character \n`crunch <min> <max> <character-set>`\n```\n# Sirf digits (0-9), length 4\ncrunch 4 4 0123456789\n------------------------------\n\n# Custom chars: lowercase + digits\ncrunch 3 5 abc123\n```"},
		{"id":"85107ac1be479984","x":470,"y":820,"width":577,"height":293,"type":"text","text":"### Wordlist Ko File Mein Save Karna (`-o`)\n`crunch <min> <max> <charset> -o <filename>`\n```\n# Numbers ke saath wordlist save karna\ncrunch 4 6 0123456789 -o numbers.txt\n--------------------------------------------\n\n# Alphanumeric wordlist save\ncrunch 5 8 abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789 -o alphanum.txt\n```"},
		{"id":"8c81bb7c5c395d37","x":470,"y":1220,"width":577,"height":149,"type":"text","text":"### Minimum Word Length Set Karna (`-m`)\n```\n# Minimum 4 characters\ncrunch 4 6 abc123\n```"},
		{"id":"8447bdf2b56cf459","x":470,"y":1420,"width":577,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"## Character Set Rules (Important Logic)"},
		{"id":"76e4c39ec9222beb","x":1160,"y":1319,"width":387,"height":263,"type":"text","text":"### Default Order\n\n**Crunch mein character set ka order FIXED hai:**\n\n1. Lowercase (`a-z`)\n    \n2. Uppercase (`A-Z`)\n    \n3. Numbers (`0-9`)\n    \n4. Symbols (`!@#$...`)\n    \n\n**Agar order galat diya toh output galat  aayega**"},
		{"id":"b1261e1430943403","x":597,"y":1820,"width":324,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"### Plus Sign (`+`) as Placeholder"},
		{"id":"38ae09c65ee92557","x":1060,"y":1820,"width":253,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Agar kisi character type ko use nahi karna toh `+` use karo"},
		{"id":"3a688ca033b337b2","x":977,"y":1940,"width":419,"height":95,"type":"text","text":"```\n# Sirf lowercase + numbers (uppercase skip)\ncrunch 3 3 abc + 123 -t @%\n```"},
		{"id":"4449607555b28e61","x":-540,"y":-44,"width":50,"height":68,"type":"text","text":"# 1"},
		{"id":"d447b6ad284e6fa1","type":"text","text":"# Crunch","x":-660,"y":3261,"width":115,"height":60},
		{"id":"3820b86a0896bcab","type":"text","text":"> Crunch ek command-line tool hai jo user ke diye gaye rules ke hisaab se combinations generate karta hai.","x":-460,"y":3240,"width":479,"height":102},
		{"id":"2304317ef6f59f4b","type":"text","text":"```\ncrunch <min-len> <max-len> [charset] -t [pattern] -o <filename>\n```","x":237,"y":3240,"width":577,"height":102,"color":"#030303"},
		{"id":"24ca8a2d85fbbcff","type":"text","text":"# 2","x":-860,"y":3257,"width":50,"height":68},
		{"id":"b7793db4f67d8239","x":816,"y":1540,"width":323,"height":185,"type":"text","text":"```\nSymbol\tMeaning\n@\t    Lowercase letter (a-z)\n,\t    Uppercase letter (A-Z)\n%\t    Number (0-9)\n^\t    Symbol (!@#$...)\n```"},
		{"id":"b8fed881ab47922c","x":1196,"y":3380,"width":340,"height":155,"type":"text","text":"```\n3 -> min\n5 -> max\n-O -> for output with file name\nmore -> for fullscreen\n```"},
		{"id":"a2c88d54d65d984e","x":760,"y":3417,"width":363,"height":80,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"```\ncrunch 3 5 -0 wordlist | more\n```"},
		{"id":"5037498afa43daa4","type":"text","text":"```\nSymbol\tMeaning\n@\t    Lowercase letter (a-z)\n,\t    Uppercase letter (A-Z)\n%\t    Number (0-9)\n^\t    Symbol (!@#$...)\n```","x":364,"y":3640,"width":323,"height":185},
		{"id":"3c61909fa213f502","x":760,"y":3570,"width":371,"height":95,"type":"text","text":"```\npath => predefiend character set file \n-t   => specific pattern\n```"},
		{"id":"9a0891775555d973","x":762,"y":3510,"width":361,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"`/usr/share/crunch/charset.lst`"},
		{"id":"0c5bb1b33cf513f5","x":786,"y":3695,"width":319,"height":76,"type":"text","text":"```\ncrunch 4 4 path -t ,,%%%\n```"},
		{"id":"f882b1c2a0069dcf","x":1196,"y":3703,"width":74,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`AB123`"},
		{"id":"7267456b672e016e","x":-200,"y":3553,"width":260,"height":360,"type":"text","text":"| Pattern  | Sample Output |\n| -------- | ------------- |\n| @@,,%%^^ | abAB01!@      |\n| @@,,%%^^ | cdCD23#$      |\n| @@,,%%^^ | efEF45%^      |\n| @@,,%%^^ | ghGH67&*      |\n| @@,,%%^^ | ijIJ89()      |\n| @@,,%%^^ | klKL10-_      |\n| @@,,%%^^ | mnMN22+=      |\n| @@,,%%^^ | opOP34[]      |\n| @@,,%%^^ | qrQR56{}      |\n| @@,,%%^^ | stST78<>      |\n"},
		{"id":"06f9e0053c4e97ba","x":-540,"y":4000,"width":1515,"height":338,"type":"text","text":"| Scenario                                              | Crunch Pattern | Length | Sample Outputs (10 examples)                                                                                                              |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 4 lowercase + @ + 3 lowercase                         | `@@@@^@@@`     | 8      | `abcd@xyz`, `test#abc`, `home!run`, `love$cat`, `dark@sky`, `code#dev`, `rain&bow`, `moon*day`, `blue@fox`, `king$man`                    |\n| Name + @ + 3 numbers (AMAN@123 type)                  | `,,,,^%%%`     | 8      | `AMAN@123`, `RAJ#456`, `MOH@789`, `KUM$321`, `DEV!555`, `RAM@001`, `VIK#999`, `AJAY$777`, `ROH!222`, `SUN@888`                            |\n| 4 lowercase + @ + 3 numbers                           | `@@@@^%%%`     | 8      | `abcd@123`, `test#456`, `home$789`, `love!111`, `dark@222`, `code#333`, `rain$444`, `moon!555`, `blue@666`, `king#777`                    |\n| 4 uppercase + @ + 4 numbers                           | `,,,,^%%%%`    | 9      | `AMAN@1234`, `RAJU#5678`, `MOHD$9999`, `KING!1111`, `USER@2222`, `TEST#3333`, `DEMO$4444`, `DATA!5555`, `ROOT@6666`, `ADMIN#7777`         |\n| First letter uppercase + rest lowercase + @ + numbers | `,@@@^%%%`     | 8      | `Aman@123`, `Raj#456`, `Moh@789`, `Dev$321`, `Ram!555`, `Vik@001`, `Roh#999`, `Sun$777`, `Jay!222`, `Tom@888`                             |\n| Name + birth year style                               | `,,,,^%%%%`    | 9      | `AMAN@1999`, `RAJU#2000`, `MOHD$2001`, `KING!2020`, `TEST@2025`, `USER#1998`, `DATA$1997`, `DEMO!1996`, `ROCK@1995`, `STAR#1994`          |\n| Lowercase word + symbol + number                      | `@@@@^%%%%`    | 9      | `love@1234`, `king#5678`, `blue$2025`, `moon!1111`, `dark@9999`, `fire#2024`, `rain$2023`, `star!2022`, `wind@2021`, `tree#2020`          |\n| Uppercase name + symbol + 3 digit                     | `,,,,^%%%`     | 8      | `AMAN@123`, `RAJU#456`, `VIKS$789`, `ROH!321`, `KUM@555`, `DEV#777`, `SUN$888`, `AJAY!999`, `MOH@111`, `RAM#222`                          |\n| Mobile ending style                                   | `@@@@%%%%%%`   | 10     | `aman123456`, `raj987654`, `test111222`, `home333444`, `love555666`, `king777888`, `dark999000`, `code123789`, `blue456123`, `moon789456` |\n| Mixed strong password style                           | `,@@@^%%%%`    | 9      | `Aman@1234`, `Raj#5678`, `Dev$9999`, `King!1111`, `User@2222`, `Test#3333`, `Root$4444`, `Data!5555`, `Rock@6666`, `Star#7777`            |\n"},
		{"id":"7cee7f5fa82e8f59","x":455,"y":3120,"width":141,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"#### Permutation"},
		{"id":"a5167b8ac1f4fd51","x":362,"y":2960,"width":327,"height":91,"type":"text","text":"```\ncrunch 4 6 -P AKASH KUMAR APRIL\n```"},
		{"id":"27f83f0ec0dfb26a","x":324,"y":2840,"width":403,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"> set possible words -> AKASH KUMAR APRIL"},
		{"id":"da169be9cbec5cda","x":947,"y":2960,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"> Storage"},
		{"id":"efc4e958f84a2d6b","x":940,"y":2715,"width":257,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"> Lines"},
		{"id":"c1580bb3b0354f3d","x":910,"y":2601,"width":318,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`-c 10` => after ten Line \nCondition full-fill hone ke bad new line"},
		{"id":"2588cfad4e92f950","type":"text","text":"`-b 10KB` => after 10KB \nCondition full-fill hone ke bad new file","x":913,"y":3080,"width":318,"height":60},
		{"id":"c691c93c0d28df5a","x":568,"y":2100,"width":383,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"### Custom Character Sets with Pattern"},
		{"id":"fe22837d709e7758","x":1082,"y":2098,"width":240,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`crunch 3 3 abc + 123 -t @%`"},
		{"id":"6298bc82d9e6f17d","x":1440,"y":2066,"width":245,"height":125,"type":"text","text":"```\n- `@` = `abc` se lega\n    \n- `%` = `123` se lega\n```"},
		{"id":"f8104e2da38af3fa","x":602,"y":2260,"width":315,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"### Multiple Words Permutation"},
		{"id":"b4cd57d0f5e9b477","x":1081,"y":2261,"width":259,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`crunch 4 4 -p dog cat bird`"},
		{"id":"7d9a81196b4b11f0","x":1440,"y":2204,"width":112,"height":175,"type":"text","text":"birdcatdog\nbirddogcat\ncatbirddog\ncatdogbird\ndogbirdcat\ndogcatbird"},
		{"id":"af196d47459dc7d1","x":1082,"y":2421,"width":456,"height":170,"type":"text","text":"Kahan Se Start Karna Hai (-s)\n\nMaano aapko 0000 se 9999 tak PIN banane hain, lekin aap 5000 se start karna chahte ho (kyunki baaki pehle hi crack ho chuke hain)."},
		{"id":"732c36580fa2c53e","x":1640,"y":2476,"width":265,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`crunch 4 4 0123456789 -s 5000`"},
		{"id":"47b841563159e3c0","x":2000,"y":2434,"width":70,"height":145,"type":"text","text":"5000\n5001\n5002\n...\n9999"},
		{"id":"10914e1ffaddd348","x":785,"y":2451,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"### Where to start"},
		{"id":"3caee3408c3a6e00","x":284,"y":2451,"width":284,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"### Kahan Tak Jaana Hai (`-e`)"},
		{"id":"064e79e8fb359f18","x":-80,"y":2451,"width":264,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"`crunch 4 4 0123456789 -e 4999`"},
		{"id":"0bcea81eacee8c6d","x":-166,"y":2340,"width":437,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"`0000` se `4999` tak aayega, `5000` ke baad ruk jaayega."},
		{"id":"d612e8b6f341f9a1","x":-69,"y":2644,"width":389,"height":76,"type":"text","text":"> Note crunch learn practically full day"}
	],
